Package: roversoftware-basestation
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Yojan Gautam <gautamyojan0@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-serial, python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-websockets, python3-pygame, curl, fonts-dejavu-core, fonts-noto-color-emoji
Recommends: chromium-browser | chromium, fonts-roboto
Description: RoverSoftware base-station dashboard (kiosk)
 Web dashboard to monitor and drive the roversoftware robot fleet over XBee.
 Installs to /opt/roversoftware-basestation and runs a local server as the
 roversoftware-basestation systemd service (started on boot).
 .
 On a Raspberry Pi booted to the desktop, a /etc/xdg/autostart entry launches
 a full-screen, touch-friendly Chromium kiosk pointed at the dashboard.
 .
 Per-instance settings live in /etc/roversoftware/basestation.env. Requires
 Raspberry Pi OS / Debian Bookworm or newer for the packaged FastAPI/uvicorn.
